# A window opened while a fullscreen is up is never laid out, so it has no box.
# Found by the fuzz in eleven scripts, the leaf side of the rule the three container
# fixtures pinned down: sway's arrange gives the fullscreen node the output and returns,
# and `container_create` leaves everything it did not visit at zero.
# recorded from sway version 1.12-8886939 (Aug  5 2026, branch 'HEAD')
# client 400x285

$ open
workspace splith focus=1
  window 1 0.000,0.000 1.000x1.000

$ fullscreen toggle
workspace splith focus=1
  window 1 0.000,0.000 1.000x1.000

$ open
workspace splith focus=1
  window 1 0.000,0.000 1.000x1.000
  window 2 0.000,0.000 0.000x0.000 hidden
